          "blockId": "[\"3-continue-with-sft-and-verifiable-grpo\",1]",
          "anchor": "3-continue-with-sft-and-verifiable-grpo",
          "quote": "Both continuation stages use language-side rank-16 LoRA, alpha 32, and zero dropout. Vision weights, input embeddings, and the output head remain frozen. The implementation uses Transformers 5.19.0, PEFT 0.21.2, and TRL 1.15.0 with an atomic resume loop; it does not use verl or Unsloth for these reported runs.",
